              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho aranyereka, mbona ibisimbo bibiri vy’insukoni biteretse imbere y’urusengero rw’ Uhoraho, igihe Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babuloni yar’ amaze kujana Yekoniya mwene Yehoyakimu, umwami w’i Buyuda, kw inyagano, bo n’abaganwa b’i Buyuda n’ababāji n’abacuzi, abakūra i Yerusalemu abashikana i Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 28:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 29:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igisimbo kimwe carimw’ insukoni nziza cane, zimeze nk’insukoni z’isega: ikindi gisimbo carimw’ insukoni ziboze rwose, zitoshoboka kuribga kubgo kubora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho arambaza, at’ Ubonye iki ga Yeremiya? Ndamwishura, nti Mbonye insukoni; inziza ni nziza cane, iziboze ziraboze cane, zitoshoboka kuribga kubgo kubora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ijambo ry’Uhoraho rinzako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rit’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ni we Mana y’Abisirayeli, ati Nk’uk’ umuntu yokwerekeza umutima kur’ izi nsukoni nziza, ni ko nzowerekeza ku Bayuda, kugira ngo mbagirire neza, abo narungitse ar’ inyagano, ngo bave aha hantu baje mu gihugu c’Abakaludaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
